PM5 (net031 net052 VDD VDD) mp18 w=1.875e-05 l=8.372e-07 m=15 //// *Input* *gm2*
PM4 (net050 net050 VDD VDD) mp18 w=1.967e-05 l=1.488e-06 m=11 //// *Load* *gm1* ``PM3``
